    skos:prefLabel "6A Application of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-6a ;
    values:originalText "Chapter 2 of the Criminal Code applies to all offences against this Act. Note: Chapter 2 of the Criminal Code sets out the general principles of criminal responsibility." ;
