    skos:prefLabel "34B(2) Authorising an authorisation for the disclosure of prospective"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-34b-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) To avoid doubt, information or documents do not relate to the fact of a communication passing over a telecommunications system to the extent that the information is, or the documents contain, the contents or substance of a communication." ;
    skos:definition "(2) To avoid doubt, information or documents do not relate to the fact of a communication passing over a telecommunications system to the extent that the information is, or the documents contain, the contents or substance of a communication."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4d8c24770a531e3d9f7046da308e2e327586628d16ce58c03c60aafd4410b443" ;
