concept:international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995-sec-39-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "39(3) Transit"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-39-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If: (a) a person is being held in custody pursuant to a direction under subsection (2); and (b) the person’s transportation is not, in the Attorney-General’s opinion, continued within a reasonable time; the Attorney-General may direct that the person be transported in custody to the foreign country from which the person was first transported.   Other forms of assistance to a Tribunal  Part 4 Service of process  Division 5 Section 40 International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995 Compilation date: 28/03/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(3) If: (a) a person is being held in custody pursuant to a direction under subsection (2); and (b) the person’s transportation is not, in the Attorney-General’s opinion, continued within a reasonable time; the Attorney-General may direct that the person be transported in custody to the foreign country from which the person was first transported.   Other forms of assistance to a Tribunal  Part 4 Service of process  Division 5 Section 40 International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995 Compilation date: 28/03/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8dcdb0666571c97b05c5ff53cac3ca90fd2be52fc7ceb7e11748ef107d8c6e93" ;
