concept:international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995-sec-40ab a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40AB Authorising applications under the Proceeds of Crime Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-40ab ;
    values:originalText "The Attorney-General may authorise, in writing, an authorised officer of an enforcement agency to make such applications under the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 as are necessary to respond to the proceeds request if the Attorney-General is satisfied that the proceeds request: (a) relates to a proceeding before, or an investigation conducted by, the Tribunal; and (b) is for assistance that can be obtained from one or more production orders, monitoring orders or search warrants under the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002. Note: See Subdivision B for proceeds requests that involve the making of a restraining order.   Other forms of assistance to a Tribunal  Part 4 Identification, tracing, and freezing or seizure, of proceeds of Tribunal offences" ;
    skos:definition "The Attorney-General may authorise, in writing, an authorised officer of an enforcement agency to make such applications under the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 as are necessary to respond to the proceeds request if the Attorney-General is satisfied that the proceeds request: (a) relates to a proceeding before, or an investigation conducted by, the Tribunal; and (b) is for assistance that can be obtained from one or more production orders, monitoring orders or search warrants under the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002. Note: See Subdivision B for proceeds requests that involve the making of a restraining order.   Other forms of assistance to a Tribunal  Part 4 Identification, tracing, and freezing or seizure, of proceeds of Tribunal offences"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9011cafb6d48d80a452b536da04af1cfe74cf532ebb6a00cd52a0149362e9345" ;
    cof:pageNumber "52"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Attorney-General may authorise an officer to make applications under the Proceeds of Crime Act." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995.pdf> ;
    dc:source "international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995.pdf, p.52" ;
    cml:asserts concept:international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995-sec-40ab-norm .
