doc:sec-40ap-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "40AP(2) Applying for and issuing search warrants" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Part 3-5 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 applies to the application, and to any POCA search warrant issued as a result." ;
    cof:pageNumber "60"^^xsd:integer .

concept:international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995-sec-40ap-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40AP(3) Applying for and issuing search warrants"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-40ap-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) That Part applies as if: (a) a reference in that Part to tainted property were a reference to proceeds of the Tribunal offence that is the subject of the proceeds request; and (b) a reference in that Part to evidential material were a reference to evidential material as defined in section 4 of this Act for the purposes of this Subdivision; and (c) the words “or section 40AS, 40AT or 40AU of the International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995” were inserted after “this Act” in paragraph 254(1)(a) of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002; and   Other forms of assistance to a Tribunal  Part 4 Identification, tracing, and freezing or seizure, of proceeds of Tribunal offences" ;
    skos:definition "(3) That Part applies as if: (a) a reference in that Part to tainted property were a reference to proceeds of the Tribunal offence that is the subject of the proceeds request; and (b) a reference in that Part to evidential material were a reference to evidential material as defined in section 4 of this Act for the purposes of this Subdivision; and (c) the words “or section 40AS, 40AT or 40AU of the International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995” were inserted after “this Act” in paragraph 254(1)(a) of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002; and   Other forms of assistance to a Tribunal  Part 4 Identification, tracing, and freezing or seizure, of proceeds of Tribunal offences"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a3bc5fbafe1d2d26332e8a0bfa1c19565c8ffe289c2e38926a97386a81f37949" ;
