concept:international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995-sec-40as a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40AS Return of seized property to third parties"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-40as ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person who claims an interest in property that has been seized under a POCA search warrant in relation to a Tribunal offence may apply to a court for an order that the property be returned to the person. (2) The court must be a court of the State or Territory in which the POCA search warrant was issued that has proceeds jurisdiction.   Other forms of assistance to a Tribunal  Part 4 Identification, tracing, and freezing or seizure, of proceeds of Tribunal offences" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person who claims an interest in property that has been seized under a POCA search warrant in relation to a Tribunal offence may apply to a court for an order that the property be returned to the person. (2) The court must be a court of the State or Territory in which the POCA search warrant was issued that has proceeds jurisdiction.   Other forms of assistance to a Tribunal  Part 4 Identification, tracing, and freezing or seizure, of proceeds of Tribunal offences"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e1ae3e2d06eda171e6cf7b16ec556e206d38a3123d45cea57ca34208ef15ad78" ;
    cof:pageNumber "62"^^xsd:integer ;
