doc:sec-40at-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "40AT(1) Dealing with certain seized property" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) Property must be dealt with in accordance with this section if: (a) it has been seized under a POCA search warrant in relation to a Tribunal offence; and (b) it is not: (i) evidential material; or (ii) property of a kind referred to in subparagraph 40AR(a)(iv) or (v). General rule—property to be returned after 30 days" ;
