doc:sec-40at-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "40AT(2) Dealing with certain seized property" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) If, at the end of the period of 30 days after the day the property was seized: (a) a forfeiture order in relation to the property has not been registered in a court under Part 6; and (b) a restraining order has not been made as described in Subdivision B in respect of the property in relation to the Tribunal offence;" ;
