concept:international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995-sec-46a-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "46A(3) Effect on third parties of registration of forfeiture orders"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-46a-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A person who was given notice of, or appeared at, the hearing held in connection with the making of the forfeiture order is not entitled to apply under subsection (1) unless the court gives leave." ;
    skos:definition "(3) A person who was given notice of, or appeared at, the hearing held in connection with the making of the forfeiture order is not entitled to apply under subsection (1) unless the court gives leave."@en ;
