concept:international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995-sec-51-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "51(4) Restrictions on personal searches"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-51-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If an application is made to a magistrate under this section and the magistrate, after considering the information and having received and considered such further information (if any) as the magistrate requires, is satisfied that:   Search, seizure and powers of arrest  Part 7 Search warrants  Division 1 Section 53 International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995 Compilation date: 28/03/2026 (a) a warrant in the terms of the application should be issued urgently; or (b) the delay that would occur if an application were made in person would frustrate the effective execution of the warrant; the magistrate may complete and sign the same form of warrant that would be issued under section 47. 53  Formalities relating to warrants issued by telephone etc." ;
    skos:definition "(4) If an application is made to a magistrate under this section and the magistrate, after considering the information and having received and considered such further information (if any) as the magistrate requires, is satisfied that:   Search, seizure and powers of arrest  Part 7 Search warrants  Division 1 Section 53 International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995 Compilation date: 28/03/2026 (a) a warrant in the terms of the application should be issued urgently; or (b) the delay that would occur if an application were made in person would frustrate the effective execution of the warrant; the magistrate may complete and sign the same form of warrant that would be issued under section 47. 53  Formalities relating to warrants issued by telephone etc."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f04a701fbfbc3fd2649b285abec93d51981673642ca3b12c68643d37e277c75d" ;
    values:partOf concept:international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995-sec-51 ;
    cof:pageNumber "78"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Magistrate must complete warrant form for documents Magistrate may issue warrant urgently or complete and sign form of warrant" ;
    dc:description "warrant form" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
