concept:international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995-sec-54-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "54(5) Availability of assistance and use of force in executing a warrant"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-54-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) The copy of the warrant referred to in subsections (1), (2) and (3) need not include the signature of the magistrate who issued it or the seal of the relevant court.   Search, seizure and powers of arrest  Part 7 Provisions relating to execution of search warrants  Division 2 Section 56 International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995 Compilation date: 28/03/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(5) The copy of the warrant referred to in subsections (1), (2) and (3) need not include the signature of the magistrate who issued it or the seal of the relevant court.   Search, seizure and powers of arrest  Part 7 Provisions relating to execution of search warrants  Division 2 Section 56 International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995 Compilation date: 28/03/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "906a99a4011098ad4d106e6aebdbb706cecf17e9c928c2724ee56874721d0904" ;
