    skos:definition "(1) This section applies if a police officer suspects, on reasonable grounds, that: (a) evidential material is in or on a conveyance; and (b) it is necessary to exercise a power under subsection (2) in order to prevent the material from being concealed, lost or destroyed; and (c) it is necessary to exercise the power without the authority of a search warrant because the circumstances are serious and urgent."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b5fce96f9de8c62fe3ca1db801bf04535361a34d7d635c4df6ce5d403299d37a" ;
