    skos:prefLabel "71(6) Power to conduct an ordinary search or strip search"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-71-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) A police officer who gives or refuses to give an approval for the purposes of paragraph (2)(c) must make a record of the decision and of the reasons for the decision.   Search, seizure and powers of arrest  Part 7 Arrest and related matters  Division 4 Section 72 International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995 Compilation date: 28/03/2026" ;
