concept:international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995-sec-79 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "79 Arrest of person released on bail"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-79 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A police officer may, without warrant, arrest a person who has been released on bail under this Act if the police officer has reasonable grounds for believing that the person has contravened, or is about to contravene, a term or condition of a recognisance on which bail was granted to the person. (2) A person arrested under subsection (1) must, as soon as practicable, be brought before the court by which the person was admitted to bail. 80  Aiding persons to escape etc. Sections 46, 46A, 47A, 47C and 48 of the Crimes Act 1914 have effect as if: (a) arrest pursuant to this Act were arrest in respect of an offence against a law of the Commonwealth; and (b) custody while in Australia pursuant to this Act were custody in respect of an offence against a law of the Commonwealth.   Miscellaneous  Part 8  Section 81 International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995 Compilation date: 28/03/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A police officer may, without warrant, arrest a person who has been released on bail under this Act if the police officer has reasonable grounds for believing that the person has contravened, or is about to contravene, a term or condition of a recognisance on which bail was granted to the person. (2) A person arrested under subsection (1) must, as soon as practicable, be brought before the court by which the person was admitted to bail. 80  Aiding persons to escape etc. Sections 46, 46A, 47A, 47C and 48 of the Crimes Act 1914 have effect as if: (a) arrest pursuant to this Act were arrest in respect of an offence against a law of the Commonwealth; and (b) custody while in Australia pursuant to this Act were custody in respect of an offence against a law of the Commonwealth.   Miscellaneous  Part 8  Section 81 International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995 Compilation date: 28/03/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e1d2b4dbbe4c37dc63b7499338440af368701af46e21f09d345c98515645622e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "98"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995-sec-79-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995-sec-79-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995.pdf> ;
    dc:source "international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995.pdf, p.98" .
