    values:originalText "This Act does not prevent provision of assistance to a Tribunal otherwise than under this Act.   Miscellaneous  Part 8  Section 85 International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995 Compilation date: 28/03/2026" ;
    skos:definition "This Act does not prevent provision of assistance to a Tribunal otherwise than under this Act.   Miscellaneous  Part 8  Section 85 International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995 Compilation date: 28/03/2026"@en ;
